{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE2LTIwMjAvTW9uYSUyMERhcmxpbmclMjAlMjgyMDE3JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Mona Darling","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/f7NhXgX6PbbRs3wExlop8p5VpIM.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9GV5TzxRJ4Er0ue9bK4Ej8Dkyk2.jpg","description":"A contemporary who-dunnit, with a splash of supernatural, set in a college campus somewhere in India (a la Indian Institute Of Technology) where a few mysterious deaths occur and the only common link between the victims is that, seconds before their deaths, they all accepted a 'facebook friend request' from a certain profile page of Mona_Darling. The person behind the said page, Mona happens to be missing. Her friend, and a fellow student, Sarah recruits the help of a classmate, Wiki - a borderline sociopathic genius. This odd-couple of amateur sleuths carry on their investigation as the story leads them into unexpected corners and terrifying revelations. It's a pacy thriller, confined to limited locations on one single campus, populated by fresh, sexy, young characters that can be executed on a fairly shoestring budget. More importantly it captures the present zeitgeist of young India and its obsession with social networking.\n\nRated UA · Released 24 Feb 2017 · India · Language: Hindi · 103 min\nStudio: Alt J Films, First Ray Films\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi","releaseInfo":"2017","genres":["Thriller","Horror","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.0","runtime":"103 min","cast":["Anushman Jha","Divya Menon","Suzanna Mukherjee","Sanjay Suri"],"director":["Shashi Sudigala"],"released":"2017-02-24T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Shashi Sudigala","character":"Director"},{"name":"Anushman Jha","character":"Wiki"},{"name":"Divya Menon","character":"Sarah","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8901oy2DDWrsM2WM3jlcFaMZDqU.jpg"},{"name":"Suzanna Mukherjee","character":"Mona","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1LYl4tKwz0Aw